  'Derived 2026-09-01 from ontario.ca''s written limits ("Highway 401 from Morningside to Highway 412") routed against Ontario Road Network freeway centrelines (Ontario GeoHub / MNRF), then buffered 30 m around every carriageway within 200 m of the route. Derived roadway length 21.20 km. Official limits resolved to 43.7961,-79.1967 and 43.8648,-78.9733 on the ORN centrelines. Not an official boundary: Ontario publishes none.',
  'https://www.ontario.ca/page/tow-zone-program',
  'Tow Zone Program — Government of Ontario, restricted towing zones table (zone 1D)',
  '2021-03-02',
  now(),
  true,
  'Vous etes dans la zone de remorquage restreint 1D de l''Ontario (Highway 401 from Morningside to Highway 412). Seule l''entreprise autorisee pour cette zone peut remorquer votre vehicule; il s''agit de Classic Towing & Storage Service. Composez le 911 s''il s''agit d''une urgence ou si vous ne pouvez pas deplacer votre vehicule hors des voies de circulation; sinon composez le 511 et choisissez l''option du programme de zones de remorquage. TowConnect ne peut pas envoyer un remorqueur ici.',
  'You are in Ontario restricted towing zone 1D (Highway 401 from Morningside to Highway 412). Only the company authorized for this zone may tow your vehicle; that company is Classic Towing & Storage Service. Call 911 if this is an emergency or you cannot move your vehicle out of a travelled lane; otherwise call 511 and select the Tow Zone Program option. TowConnect cannot send a truck here.',
  '511',
  5
);
