  'derived_from_official_text',
  'Derived 2026-09-01 from ontario.ca''s written limits ("Highway 400 from Highway 401 to Highway 9") routed against Ontario Road Network freeway centrelines (Ontario GeoHub / MNRF), then buffered 30 m around every carriageway within 200 m of the route. Derived roadway length 35.76 km. Official limits resolved to 43.7164,-79.5182 and 44.0295,-79.5940 on the ORN centrelines. Not an official boundary: Ontario publishes none.',
  'https://www.ontario.ca/page/tow-zone-program',
  'Tow Zone Program — Government of Ontario, restricted towing zones table (zone 3A)',
  '2021-03-02',
  now(),
  true,
  'Vous etes dans la zone de remorquage restreint 3A de l''Ontario (Highway 400 from Highway 401 to Highway 9). Seule l''entreprise autorisee pour cette zone peut remorquer votre vehicule; il s''agit de Fellow''s Towing. Composez le 911 s''il s''agit d''une urgence ou si vous ne pouvez pas deplacer votre vehicule hors des voies de circulation; sinon composez le 511 et choisissez l''option du programme de zones de remorquage. TowConnect ne peut pas envoyer un remorqueur ici.',
  'You are in Ontario restricted towing zone 3A (Highway 400 from Highway 401 to Highway 9). Only the company authorized for this zone may tow your vehicle; that company is Fellow''s Towing. Call 911 if this is an emergency or you cannot move your vehicle out of a travelled lane; otherwise call 511 and select the Tow Zone Program option. TowConnect cannot send a truck here.',
  '511',
  5
);
