  'derived_from_official_text',
  'Derived 2026-09-01 from ontario.ca''s written limits ("Highway 401 (Islington to 400); Highway 409 (427 to 401); Highway 427 (409 to QEW)") routed against Ontario Road Network freeway centrelines (Ontario GeoHub / MNRF), then buffered 30 m around every carriageway within 200 m of the route. Derived roadway length 17.39 km. Not an official boundary: Ontario publishes none.',
  'https://www.ontario.ca/page/tow-zone-program',
  'Tow Zone Program — Government of Ontario, restricted towing zones table (zone 3C)',
  '2021-03-02',
  now(),
  true,
  'Vous etes dans la zone de remorquage restreint 3C de l''Ontario (Highway 401 (Islington to 400); Highway 409 (427 to 401); Highway 427 (409 to QEW)). Seule l''entreprise autorisee pour cette zone peut remorquer votre vehicule; il s''agit de Bill & Son Towing. Composez le 911 s''il s''agit d''une urgence ou si vous ne pouvez pas deplacer votre vehicule hors des voies de circulation; sinon composez le 511 et choisissez l''option du programme de zones de remorquage. TowConnect ne peut pas envoyer un remorqueur ici.',
  'You are in Ontario restricted towing zone 3C (Highway 401 (Islington to 400); Highway 409 (427 to 401); Highway 427 (409 to QEW)). Only the company authorized for this zone may tow your vehicle; that company is Bill & Son Towing. Call 911 if this is an emergency or you cannot move your vehicle out of a travelled lane; otherwise call 511 and select the Tow Zone Program option. TowConnect cannot send a truck here.',
  '511',
  5
);
